# ============================================================================
# OPC API — Integration test environment template
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to `.env.test` (apps/api/.env.test) and fill in real
# values BEFORE running:
#
#   set -a; source apps/api/.env.test; set +a
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=$ANTHROPIC_API_KEY \
#     go test -tags integration -race ./internal/agents/...
#
# The Makefile target `test-integration` does this for you. It skips
# gracefully when ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is not set, so the suite is safe
# to wire into CI behind a secret store.
#
# NEVER commit a populated copy to git. The `.env.test` filename is
# already in `.gitignore` for this reason.
# ============================================================================

# ---- Real Claude API key ----------------------------------------------------
# Required to exercise the integration tests. The tests Skip (not Fail)
# when this variable is empty, so an unset key in a developer shell is
# safe — the regular test suite still runs and passes.
#
# Get a key from https://console.anthropic.com/. The integration suite
# uses Haiku 4.5 by default to keep cost well under a cent per run.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ---- Optional: per-test model override --------------------------------------
# Pin the integration tests to a specific model when validating a
# rollout. When unset, the test uses the cheap default (Haiku 4.5).
# Example: INTEGRATION_CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5
# INTEGRATION_CLAUDE_MODEL=

# ---- Optional: per-call timeout override ------------------------------------
# Seconds. The default in code is 90s per call. Lower this to fail
# fast on a slow day (and surface regressions where the model starts
# taking 60s+ to reply). Set to 0 to use the code default.
# INTEGRATION_TIMEOUT_SEC=90

# ---- Optional: target base URL override -------------------------------------
# Point at the staging or local proxy instead of the production
# Anthropic endpoint. Leave empty to hit api.anthropic.com.
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=
